OL,3,GHighlands & Eilean Siar
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FThe Isles and Northwest
OL,6,FHighlands will be cloudy with showery
OL,7,Frain, some heavy. East Highland
OL,8,Fbrighter with sunny intervals and a
OL,9,Ffew showers, and becoming very warm.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTonight:FStaying cloudy in the west
OL,12,Fwith perhaps some haar in places.
OL,13,FFurther occasionally heavy showers
OL,14,Fthrough the evening and overnight,
OL,15,Fturning persistent at times.
OL,16,
OL,17,CThursday:FFurther occasionally heavy
OL,18,Fshowers or longer spells of rain,
OL,19,Fespecially northwest, but very warm in
OL,20,Feast.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
