OL,3,GHighlands & Eilean Siar
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Friday to Sunday:FVariable
OL,6,Fcloud and scattered showers from
OL,7,FFriday to Sunday, though some bright
OL,8,Fspells developing in-between. Chance
OL,9,Fthat rain is more persistent on
OL,10,FSunday. Turning cooler.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
